OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOutbreaks of rain, heavy in the
OL,6,Fsoutheast, at first. The rain will
OL,7,Fclear east from the late morning to
OL,8,Fleave the afternoon dry with
OL,9,Fincreasing bright or sunny spells.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMostly dry with clear spells.
OL,12,FCloud will spread east from midnight
OL,13,Fwith outbreaks of rain following
OL,14,Ftowards the morning. The wind will
OL,15,Ffreshen towards morning.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,18,Frain, some heavy. The afternoon will
OL,19,Fbecome brighter as the rain turns to
OL,20,Fshowers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
