OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FVery
OL,6,Fwindy with scattered showers, becoming
OL,7,Fdrier later Sunday. Further showers
OL,8,FMonday, becoming windy with continuing
OL,9,Fshowers Tuesday.
